# Each rule is a path pattern followed by GitHub users or teams.
# The last matching rule selects the owners; no match means no automatic owner.
# These visible teams have write access to this skeleton repository.
# When adopting the skeleton, use the destination project's actual reviewers.

# Default: the repository maintainers review all paths.
* @devdocsorg/devdocsai-devs

# Documentation paths are reviewed by the documentation team.
*.md @devdocsorg/docs-reviewers
/docs/ @devdocsorg/docs-reviewers

# Both teams review the repository introduction and branch guidance.
/README.md @devdocsorg/docs-reviewers @devdocsorg/devdocsai-devs
/BRANCHES.md @devdocsorg/docs-reviewers @devdocsorg/devdocsai-devs
